/red, spaced 40' apart 21 Ee step line, the rest sile be iced ded pert in advance of TC-65.11.\n\nJ٢٢L٢ Ui ROADWAY ENGINEERING\n\nAdam Koenig\n\nENHANCED WRONG-WAY TRAFFIC CONTROL FOR RAMPS\n\nTC-73.20\n\nP.1 |", "width": 6800, "height": 4400, "blocks": [{"kind": "text", "text": "TC-73.20", "bbox": {"x": 118.6, "y": 3985.7, "width": 59.29999999999998, "height": 286.10000000000036}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "1ODEL • Sheet 1 PAPERSIZE: 34·22 in 1 DATE: 3/20/2026 TIM", "bbox": {"x": 207.6, "y": 3482.5, "width": 29.69999999999999, "height": 779.3999999999996}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "WRONG-WAY SIGN MOUNTING DETAILS", "bbox": {"x": 1027.9, "y": 1045.2, "width": 523.8, "height": 138.5999999999999}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "DO NOT", "bbox": {"x": 1176.2, "y": 1331.8, "width": 207.5999999999999, "height": 59.200000000000045}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "ENTER", "bbox": {"x": 1195.3, "y": 1467.9, "width": 179.20000000000005, "height": 63.299999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "WRONG WAY", "bbox": {"x": 1136.0, "y": 1723.1, "width": 287.9000000000001, "height": 141.50000000000023}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Support Location/Offset as", "bbox": {"x": 395.3, "y": 1508.8, "width": 484.3, "height": 50.59999999999991}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Red Reflector Post Strip (2)", "bbox": {"x": 563.4, "y": 1636.9, "width": 484.30000000000007, "height": 50.59999999999991}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "R5-1A-42", "bbox": {"x": 929.1, "y": 1775.2, "width": 177.89999999999998, "height": 50.59999999999991}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Red Reflector Post Strip (2)", "bbox": {"x": 533.7, "y": 2061.8, "width": 484.29999999999995, "height": 49.40000000000009}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "- Edge of Pavement", "bbox": {"x": 711.6, "y": 2160.5, "width": 355.80000000000007, "height": 49.59999999999991}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "ENTRANCE RAMP DIRECTIONAL SIGN ASSEMBLY (OPTIONAL)", "bbox": {"x": 731.4, "y": 2574.3, "width": 820.2999999999998, "height": 149.0999999999999}}, {"kind": "text", "